{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","license":{"attribution":"not-required","commercialUse":"allowed","derivatives":"allowed","copyleft":false,"publicDomain":true},"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"7f3935061df17430a3e12f649490c443356f4f9d0aec5a2fabe421079a31aa13","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","completeTranslationApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/complete.json","simpleCompleteTranslationApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/complete.simple.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JHN","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"约翰福音","commonName":"约翰福音","shortName":"约","title":"约翰福音","order":43,"numberOfChapters":21,"sha256":"60db8fdbedbc9ceb116382155bdc33fe74a626fe51cef33258914ec4dd6c2293","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JHN/1.json","firstChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"JHN","chapter":1},"lastChapterNumber":21,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JHN/21.json","lastChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"JHN","chapter":21},"totalNumberOfVerses":877},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶稣与尼哥德慕"]},{"type":"line_break","paragraph":"p"},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["有一个法利赛人，名叫尼哥德慕，是犹太人的官。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["这人夜里来见耶稣，说：「拉比，我们知道你是由 神那里来作师傅的；因为你所行的神迹，若没有 神同在，无人能行。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶稣回答说：「我实实在在地告诉你，人若不重生，就不能见 神的国。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["尼哥德慕说：「人已经老了，如何能重生呢？岂能再进母腹生出来吗？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶稣说：「我实实在在地告诉你，人若不是从水和圣灵生的，就不能进 神的国。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["从肉身生的就是肉身；从灵生的就是灵。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我说：『你们必须重生』，你不要以为希奇。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["风随着意思吹，你听见风的响声，却不晓得从哪里来，往哪里去；凡从圣灵生的，也是如此。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["尼哥德慕问他说：「怎能有这事呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶稣回答说：「你是以色列人的先生，还不明白这事吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我实实在在地告诉你，我们所说的是我们知道的；我们所见证的是我们见过的；你们却不领受我们的见证。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我对你们说地上的事，你们尚且不信，若说天上的事，如何能信呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["除了从天降下、仍旧在天的人子，没有人升过天。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["摩西在旷野怎样举蛇，人子也必照样被举起来，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["叫一切信他的都得永生",{"noteId":5},"。"]},{"type":"line_break","paragraph":"p"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["「 神爱世人，甚至将他的独生子赐给他们，叫一切信他的，不致灭亡，反得永生。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["因为 神差他的儿子降世，不是要定世人的罪",{"noteId":6},"，乃是要叫世人因他得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["信他的人，不被定罪；不信的人，罪已经定了，因为他不信 神独生子的名。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["光来到世间，世人因自己的行为是恶的，不爱光，倒爱黑暗，定他们的罪就是在此。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["凡作恶的便恨光，并不来就光，恐怕他的行为受责备。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["但行真理的必来就光，要显明他所行的是靠 神而行。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶稣和施洗约翰"]},{"type":"line_break","paragraph":"p"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["这事以后，耶稣和门徒到了犹太地，在那里居住，施洗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["约翰在靠近撒冷的哀嫩也施洗；因为那里水多，众人都去受洗。（"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["那时约翰还没有下在监里。）"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["约翰的门徒和一个犹太人辩论洁净的礼，"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["就来见约翰，说：「拉比，从前同你在约旦河外、你所见证的那位，现在施洗，众人都往他那里去了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["约翰说：「若不是从天上赐的，人就不能得什么。"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["我曾说：『我不是基督，是奉差遣在他前面的』，你们自己可以给我作见证。"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["娶新妇的就是新郎；新郎的朋友站着，听见新郎的声音就甚喜乐。故此，我这喜乐满足了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["他必兴旺，我必衰微。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["从天上来的那一位"]},{"type":"line_break","paragraph":"p"},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":["「从天上来的是在万有之上；从地上来的是属乎地，他所说的也是属乎地。从天上来的是在万有之上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":["他将所见所闻的见证出来，只是没有人领受他的见证。"]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":["那领受他见证的，就印上印，证明 神是真的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":["神所差来的就说 神的话，因为 神赐圣灵给他是没有限量的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":["父爱子，已将万有交在他手里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":["信子的人有永生；不信子的人得不着永生",{"noteId":7},"， 神的震怒常在他身上。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":5,"caller":"-","text":"或译：叫一切信的人在他里面得永生","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":15}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"-","text":"或译：审判世人；下同","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":17}},{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"原文是不得见永生","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":36}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JHN/3.json","thisChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"JHN","chapter":3},"thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JHN/4.json","nextChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"JHN","chapter":4},"nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JHN/2.json","previousChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"JHN","chapter":2},"previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"thisChapterAudioTimings":{},"nextChapterAudioTimings":{},"previousChapterAudioTimings":{},"numberOfVerses":36,"simpleChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JHN/3.simple.json"}